msgstr "在{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}命运交错{{/}}情景下，战斗储备的解锁顺序不受战车类型的影响。"

msgid "reserveCategories/config/header"
msgstr "储备配置（按战车类型）"

msgid "reserveCategories/config/text"
msgstr "在{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}标准战{{/}}和{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}作战支援{{/}}情景下，全部3个战斗储备槽对所有类型战车开放。不过，解锁顺序取决于战车类型。"

msgid "reserveCategories/config/vehicles/destroyer"
msgstr "坦克歼击车"

msgid "reserveCategories/config/vehicles/heavy"
msgstr "重型坦克"

msgid "reserveCategories/config/vehicles/light"
msgstr "轻型坦克"

msgid "reserveCategories/config/vehicles/middle"
msgstr "中型坦克"

msgid "reserveCategories/config/vehicles/selfPropelled"
msgstr "自行火炮"

msgid "reserveCategories/levelUpNote"
msgstr "* 仅{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}命运交错{{/}}情景下{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}购买的{{/}}战斗储备才能达到此等级。"

msgid "reserveCategories/levels/header"
msgstr "如何解锁和加强战斗储备"

msgid "reserveCategories/levels/text"
msgstr "战斗开始时，您会解锁1个战斗储备。其他储备将在您达到军士长和准尉军阶时解锁。全部3个储备将在您达到尉官和校官军阶时升级。"

msgid "reserveCategories/progression/tableCell"
msgstr "等级{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}{{level}}{{/}}或{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}{{levelNext}}*{{/}}"

msgid "reserveCategories/ranks/captain"
msgstr "尉官"

msgid "reserveCategories/ranks/general"
msgstr "将军"

msgid "reserveCategories/ranks/lieutenant"
msgstr "准尉"

msgid "reserveCategories/ranks/major"
msgstr "校官"

msgid "reserveCategories/ranks/sergeant"
msgstr "军士长"

msgid "reserveCategories/ranks/soldier"
msgstr "士兵"

msgid "reserveCategories/scenarios/random/header"
msgstr "命运交错"

msgid "reserveCategories/scenarios/random/text"
msgstr "在战斗中，玩家可以在对所有类型战车开放的随机储备选项中进行选择。战斗前若将储备放入槽位，它作为选项出现的几率将提高{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}10%{{/}}。购买储备后，获得时的初始等级会提升至{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}II{{/}}，并有机会提升至{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}IV{{/}}。"

msgid "reserveCategories/scenarios/sectionHeader"
msgstr "前线战情景"

msgid "reserveCategories/scenarios/standard/header"
msgstr "标准战"

msgid "reserveCategories/scenarios/standard/text"
msgstr "采用标准前线战规则。战斗储备的使用条件不变。"

msgid "reserveCategories/scenarios/support/header"
msgstr "作战支援"

msgid "reserveCategories/scenarios/support/list/reserveOpen"
msgstr "解锁储备时：{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}-50%{{/}}"

msgid "reserveCategories/scenarios/support/list/respawn"
msgstr "重返战斗时：{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}-70%{{/}}"

msgid "reserveCategories/scenarios/support/text"
msgstr "在此情景下，战斗节奏更快，且战斗储备的冷却时间缩短："

msgid "reserveCategories/scenarios/text"
msgstr "前线战的战斗将使用以下情景之一：{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}标准战{{/}}、{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}作战支援{{/}}或{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}命运交错{{/}}。情景会改变战斗中战斗储备的使用条件。当前战斗情景的相关信息会在加载界面、战前倒计时，或按下Tab键时显示。"

msgid "reserveCategories/sectionHeader"
msgstr "战斗储备类别"

msgid "reserveCategories/text"
msgstr "战斗储备分为3个类别，每个类别各有3个储备。进入战斗时，每个槽位中只能安装一个对应的储备。"

msgid "reserveCategories/types/firesupport"
msgstr "攻击储备"

msgid "reserveCategories/types/reconnaissance"
msgstr "侦察储备"

msgid "reserveCategories/types/tactics"
msgstr "战术储备"

msgid "reserves/sectionHeader"
msgstr "快速储备"

msgid "reserves/sectionInitialTime/header"
msgstr "快速启动"

msgid "reserves/sectionInitialTime/text"
msgstr "战斗开始时战斗储备的准备时间减少50%。"

msgid "reserves/sectionReload/header"
msgstr "立即可用"

msgid "reserves/sectionReload/text"
msgstr "战斗储备将在解锁时准备就绪。"

msgid "reserves/sectionSecondBreath/header"
msgstr "重振旗鼓"

msgid "reserves/sectionSecondBreath/text"
msgstr "使用新战车重返战斗时战斗储备准备时间缩短70%。"

msgid "rules/backToFight/header"
msgstr "返回战斗"

msgid "rules/backToFight/text"
msgstr "如果您的战车被摧毁，可以选择其他可用战车重返战场为胜利而战。您可以在数个位于侧面和后方的部署区域（重生点）之间做出有利选择，从而决定您的战斗计划。防守方玩家在战线后方有更多重生点可选，这意味着他们可以选择大后方的重生点来防守对大口径火炮的突袭。如果选择的部署区域（重生点）很危险，玩家还会收到用于警示危险的特殊指示。"

msgid "rules/base/header"
msgstr "占领基地"

msgid "rules/base/textBottom"
msgstr "击伤正在占领的战车（或模块）不会重置占领进度，只能使其暂停。要重置占领进度，\n防守方必须将占领圈中的敌方战车尽数摧毁或驱逐。基地被进攻方占领后，防守方将无法再次夺回。"

msgid "rules/base/textTop"
msgstr "{FFE4C0_Start}进攻团队{FFE4C0_End}必须按顺序占领基地才能达成主要目标。占领一个基地额外增加2分钟战斗时间，占领最后基地额外增加4分钟。"

msgid "rules/sectionHeader"
msgstr "一般规则"

msgid "rules/service/header"
msgstr "重新补给圈"

msgid "rules/service/text"
msgstr "重新补给圈恢复战车的血量，治疗受伤乘员，并补给弹药。{FFE4C0_Start}补给率为：每秒100点血量/一名乘员/10%{FFE4C0_End}的弹药。"

msgid "rules/weapons/header"
msgstr "目标：5门中的3门大口径火炮"

msgid "rules/weapons/list/back"
msgstr "后方装甲：{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}90毫米。{{/}}"

msgid "rules/weapons/list/roof"
msgstr "炮弹{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}无法穿透{{/}}顶部和正面装甲。"

msgid "rules/weapons/list/sides"
msgstr "侧面装甲：{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}180毫米。{{/}}"

msgid "rules/weapons/list/sides_9"
msgstr "侧面装甲：{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}210毫米。{{/}}"

msgid "rules/weapons/list/vulnerable"
msgstr "弱点：{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}舱门(70毫米)和通风系统(25毫米)。{{/}}"

msgid "rules/weapons/text"
msgstr "防守方团队后面的5座炮塔是这场战斗的主要目标。\n攻击方团队必须摧毁3座炮塔，防守方则需要全力保护它们。"

msgid "subTitle/differentMonth"
msgstr "{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}{{startMonth}}{{from}}日{{/}}到 {{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}{{endMonth}}{{to}}日{{/}}"

msgid "subTitle/differentYears"
msgstr "{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}{{startYear}}年{{startMonth}}{{from}}日{{/}}到 {{endYear}}年{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}{{endMonth}}{{to}}日{{/}}"

msgid "subTitle/sameMonth"
msgstr "{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}{{endMonth}}{{from}}日{{/}}到{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}{{to}}日{{/}}"

msgid "winStrategy/firstLine"
msgstr "{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}第一战线{{/}}的阵地A、B和C是两队的起始点。"

msgid "winStrategy/header"
msgstr "制胜策略"

msgid "winStrategy/mapZones"
msgstr "模式地图提供3条平行防线："

msgid "winStrategy/secondLine"
msgstr "第一战线的区域被占领后，战场将推进至{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}第二战线{{/}}的阵地D、E和F。"

msgid "winStrategy/thirdLine"
msgstr "{{@ colorLegacy 'FFE4C0'}}第三战线{{/}}不划分阵地。它是战斗最终阶段的开战区域。这里部署了大口径火炮，攻击方摧毁它们即可获得胜利。攻击方玩家在第二战线占领至少一个阵地才能接触主要目标。一旦失去阵地，防守方玩家在阵地被轰炸前有1分钟时间撤离。还驻留的防守方玩家将遭到空袭打击。试图进入第二或第三战线，但没能占领上个阵地的攻击方玩家也将被空袭摧毁。"
